  "zh": "# AGI概念持续升温，国内外多起大事件抢占热搜\n\n## AI与科技\n- **OpenAI发布GPT-6 Astra模型**：被视为通往AGI的关键一步，AI能力边界再度拓宽，引发行业对通用人工智能时间表的重新评估。\n- **阿里Qwen3.8模型登陆Cerebras**：推理速度达1500 tokens/s，国产开源模型在硬件加速领域取得突破，中美AI竞争格局生变。\n- **围棋职业九段击败AI KataGo**：人类棋手以两子优势战胜顶级围棋AI，打破“AI不可战胜”的固有认知，围棋界为之震动。\n\n## 国际与安全\n- **解放军将赴俄参加实兵演习**：中俄军事合作持续深化，演习地点和规模备受关注，地缘政治信号强烈。\n- **菲律宾法院下令逮捕副总统莎拉**：杜特尔特之女面临牢狱之灾，菲政坛动荡加剧，地区格局不确定性上升。\n- **美军航母系统接连故障**：多艘航母暴雷暴露战力缺口，美国海上霸权承压，全球军事平衡面临重塑。\n\n## 社会民生\n- **福建莆田遭遇极端暴雨**：洪水涌入民宅致多人失联，南方多地洪涝告急，防汛形势严峻。\n- **尼泊尔泥石流死亡人数破千**：遇难人数升至1293人，搜救仍在进行，灾害规模为数十年来罕见。\n\n## 娱乐八卦\n- **古天乐旗下公司被追债1.28亿**：明星商业版图再掀波澜，公众对艺人投资风险关注度飙升。",
  "en": "# AI Giants Clash as GPT-6 Astra and Qwen3.8 Redefine Capabilities\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI Unveils GPT-6 Astra**: CEO declares AGI arrival as model demonstrates unprecedented reasoning, reshaping industry timelines for artificial general intelligence.\n- **Alibaba's Qwen3.8 Hits 1500 tokens/s on Cerebras**: Chinese open-source model achieves breakthrough inference speed, intensifying US-China AI hardware race.\n- **Go Master Defeats KataGo with Two-Stone Handicap**: Professional 9-dan player Shin Jinseo defeats world-top AI, shattering myth of invincibility and sparking debate on human-AI dynamics.\n\n## Geopolitics\n- **PLA Forces Deploy to Russia for Joint Drills**: China-Russia military cooperation deepens as live-fire exercises signal strategic alignment amid global tensions.\n- **Philippine Court Orders Arrest of VP Sara Duterte**: Political crisis escalates as daughter of former president faces imprisonment, destabilizing regional alliances.\n- **US Navy Carriers Plagued by System Failures**: Multiple carrier breakdowns expose readiness gaps, challenging American maritime dominance worldwide.\n\n## Global Crisis\n- **Extreme Flooding Devastates Fujian Province**: Deadly deluge traps residents as water levels reach 3 meters indoors, emergency response stretched thin.\n- **Nepal Landslide Death Toll Surpasses 1,293**: Rescue efforts continue as catastrophic mudslide becomes Southeast Asia's deadliest natural disaster in decades."
